                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-1">
                                <span>Active Pages:</span>
                                <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">24 Pages Leaflet</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded border">0% Installment offers on Samsung, iPhone, Smart TVs, and AC units.</p>
